Sure! Here’s a concise GDPR‑style privacy notice you can add to your blog:

**Privacy Notice**

We collect your email address **only** to send you our monthly newsletter. By providing your email, you consent to us storing and processing this information for that purpose. You may withdraw your consent at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link at the bottom of any email. Under GDPR, you have the right to:
- Access the personal data we hold about you;
- Request correction of any inaccurate data;
- Request erasure of your data (the ‘right to be forgotten’);
- Restrict or object to processing.

We retain email addresses for the duration of the subscription and delete them within 30 days of unsubscription. No other personal data is collected or shared.

If you have any questions about this notice, please contact us at privacy@example.com.
